1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
I don't believe in talent. Talent alone just isn't enough anymore.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Sure, some people are naturally gifted, and that can be helpful. It gives you a head start.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
But in the end, it's not what makes the difference. What really matters is determination and willpower.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Obsession will beat talent every single time. You can have all the talent in the world,

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:27,000
but if you're not truly obsessed, if you're not giving it everything 100% dedication,

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,000
then you won't reach the level you're aiming for.

